## Cursor indexing and pulled Nucleus assets

Heavy pulled trees under `kit-app-template-main/source/data/nucleus/` (and generated seasonal textures) are listed in repo-root **`.cursorindexingignore`** so they stay **out of the index** but remain **openable** in the editor; **`.cursorignore`** holds stronger blocks (`node_modules`, build output, `.env`, etc.). See **`topics/nucleus-integration.mdc` § Cursor / AI troubleshooting** for Nucleus debugging, `@` paths, and when to relax either file.

