## Launch & Build

Run `startstream.bat [scene]` or `startcomposer.bat [scene]` from project root. Defaults to `main_scene`. These scripts **automatically build both the Kit backend and the web frontend** — never suggest separate build steps (e.g. `npm run build`, `repo build`) unless specifically debugging a build/startup issue.

**Streaming Kit profiles** (`kit-app-template-main/source/apps/`): `younite.usd_viewer_streaming_base.kit` holds **all** shared settings and the **production** extension set — launch it directly for production. `younite.usd_viewer_streaming_dev.kit` is a **thin layer** that depends on the base via `[dependencies] "younite.usd_viewer_streaming_base" = {}` and adds dev/CU-only extensions. Edit shared settings/deps **only in base**. Default `startstream.bat` launches dev; `startstream_prod.bat` launches base directly.

