## New Extension Checklist

Five steps required (missing any = silent failure). Full checklist with templates in `streaming-profiles.mdc`. Summary: (1) folder `source/extensions/younite.<name>/`, (2) `premake5.lua`, (3) `__init__.py` imports extension class, (4) `config/extension.toml`, (5) add to **dev** `.kit` file — never add directly to production without asking.

