## Streaming (frontend ↔ backend)

Frontend connects via `AppStream.tsx`; config in `web-viewer-sample-main/src/config/stream.config.json` (local: 127.0.0.1:49100). Messaging: `younite.messaging_core_extension` — outbound: `register_outbound_events()`; inbound: `IncomingMessageBridge` (wrapper event → Events 2.0). See `streaming-profiles.mdc` for Kit profile details.

