## Development Workflow

**Hot-reload**: Both sides hot-reload on file save. Kit reloads Python extensions automatically; Vite hot-reloads the frontend. Do **not** suggest restarting the app after code changes — only restart if changing `.kit` profile settings or debugging startup issues.

**Kit Python packages**: Kit bundles many Python packages (numpy, PIL/Pillow, scipy, etc.) in its own environment. Never suggest `pip install` for these -- they are already available at runtime.

